# Test Menu Navigation - Stage 1 Implementation
# Tests menu operations: openMenu, selectMenuItem

mode continue

log === Testing Menu Navigation ===

# Launch TextEdit for menu testing
launch TextEdit
wait 2

log Testing open menu
openMenu File
wait 1

log Testing select menu item - New Document
selectMenuItem File/New
wait 1

log Testing Format menu
selectMenuItem Format/Font/Show Fonts
wait 1

# Close font panel
pressKey Cmd+W
wait 0.5

log === Menu Navigation Test Complete ===
